  "description": "Core abstractions and dispatcher for the RubiconMp document processing pipeline. Supports legacy .NET Framework 4.6.2–4.8.1 apps as well as .NET Standard 2.0 and .NET 10. No browser dependency. Report issues at https://github.com/rubiconmp/public-issues",
